      "description": "Flat working surface with restrained empty-frame brackets.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-folder\"><h2>Media inspection</h2><div class=\"ds-media\">Your footage appears here</div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-folder{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:12px;padding:17px 20px 12px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface,#ffffff);color:var(--ink,#203c36)}.ds-folder h2{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}.ds-media{position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;min-height:180px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--media,#e4e9e5);color:var(--muted,#52665e)}.ds-media:before,.ds-media:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:20px;height:20px;opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}.ds-media:before{top:13px;left:13px;border-top:1px solid var(--line-strong,#b6c6be);border-left:1px solid var(--line-strong,#b6c6be)}.ds-media:after{bottom:13px;right:13px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-strong,#b6c6be);border-right:1px solid var(--line-strong,#b6c6be)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Source upload",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Real labeled file input with visible requirements.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-upload\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 16V4m-4 4 4-4 4 4M4 16v4h16v-4\"/></svg><strong>Choose source video</strong><span>MP4, MOV, WebM · 4–30s · max 500 MB</span><input type=\"file\" accept=\".mp4,.mov,.webm\"></label>",
      "css": ".ds-upload{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:12px;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:4px;min-height:94px;padding:11px;border:1px dashed var(--line-strong,#b6c6be);background:var(--field,#f5f7f5);color:var(--ink,#203c36);border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;text-align:center;transition:background .18s,border-color .18s}.ds-upload svg{fill:none;stroke:var(--primary,#215e4f);stroke-width:1.65;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-upload strong{font-weight:550}.ds-upload span{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted,#52665e)}.ds-upload input{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;opacity:0}.ds-upload:hover{background:var(--primary-soft,#e4eee7);border-color:var(--primary,#215e4f)}.ds-upload:focus-within{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#317d65);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Error toast",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Dismissible semantic feedback; sample is in flow for the component canvas.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-toast\" role=\"alert\"><span>Source video must be 4–30 seconds.</span><button aria-label=\"Close\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-toast{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:12px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;max-width:390px;padding:14px 12px 14px 15px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--danger-soft,#fff0ec);color:var(--danger,#a03734);line-height:1.7;box-shadow:var(--shadow,0 12px 36px rgb(22 48 36 / 14%))}.ds-toast span{flex:1}.ds-toast button{border:0;border-radius:9px;background:transparent;color:inherit;padding:6px;cursor:pointer}.ds-toast button:hover{background:var(--field,#f5f7f5)}.ds-toast button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#317d65);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-toast svg{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.65;stroke-linecap:round}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Contemporary Production Folder",
    "overview": "Porcelain surfaces, forest actions and brushed-silver edges create the daytime desk. Petroleum surfaces and citron actions create the nighttime desk. Both use the same proportions, precise inset fields and restrained frame brackets; the media remains the central object. The user explicitly rejects a uniformly black science-fiction dashboard.\n\nThis is a compact working environment with deliberate hierarchy rather than decorative telemetry. Manrope gives Latin headings and the brand a distinct voice; native Chinese and body typography preserve familiar reading and control behavior. Appearance changes only UI tokens, preserving entered materials, playback and ongoing work.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Two intentional working environments sharing one component grammar.",
      "Local Manrope headings and brand, with native bilingual body and controls.",
      "Fine edges, inset fields, rounded folders and restrained media-frame brackets.",
      "Visible task state with optional detail, internal inspector scrolling and anchored generation actions."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Paired Environment Rule",
        "body": "Resolve every semantic color through the active theme. A light surface or primary color must never be copied into night mode without its paired role.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Reading Ink Rule",
        "body": "Use muted ink for secondary copy, not reduced opacity. Keep semantic states named in text as well as color.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Two Voices Rule",
        "body": "Use Manrope for the brand and workspace heading; retain native bilingual sans for operational copy and controls. Reserve monospace for elapsed time.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Working Plane Rule",
        "body": "Keep working panels flat. Reserve the ambient shadow for floating history and transient feedback.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do resolve all UI colors through the active day/night semantic pair.",
      "Do keep the generation footer outside the scrolling inspector on desktop.",
      "Do use inline stroked SVG for interface icons and native video controls for inspection.",
      "Do preserve entered prompts, source media and ongoing task state when switching appearance or language.",
      "Do keep constraints near uploads and errors readable in both field feedback and dismissible toasts."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't turn night mode into a uniformly black science-fiction dashboard.",
      "Don't add shadows to every working panel; reserve them for floating history and toasts.",
      "Don't invent completion percentages, decorative metrics or pipeline states.",
      "Don't replace Manrope headings with a system display face or apply Manrope to all operational copy."
    ]
  }
}
